<section id="home" class="page current"><div class="hero"><h1>Welkom terug!</h1><p>Klaar om te meten?</p><div class="system"><span><span class="dot"></span>Systeem online</span><span id="systemSensors">Sensorstatus laden...</span></div></div><div class="content"><div class="homeactions"><button class="action start" onclick="navigate('measure')"><span class="bigicon playIconWrap" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="playIconSvg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.5 6.8v10.4c0 .8.9 1.3 1.6.9l8-5.2a1.05 1.05 0 0 0 0-1.8l-8-5.2c-.7-.4-1.6.1-1.6.9Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span><strong>Begin met meten</strong><small>Start een nieuwe sessie</small></button><button class="action data" onclick="navigate('data')"><span class="bigicon dataIconWrap" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="actionDataIcon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="16" rx="2.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 12h8M8 16h5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><strong>Bekijk je data</strong><small>Ga naar opgeslagen metingen</small></button></div><div class="sectiontitle"><h2>Live data</h2><span class="live"><span class="dot"></span>Live</span></div><div class="sensors"><article class="sensor emphasis"><div class="sensoricon"><span class="iconwrap"><span class="symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M10 14.5V5.5a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v9a4.5 4.5 0 1 1-4 0Z" stroke="#F2A51A" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M12 17.75a1.75 1.75 0 1 0 0-3.5 1.75 1.75 0 0 0 0 3.5Z" fill="#F2A51A"/><path d="M16.8 6.4h2.4M16.8 9.4h1.6M16.8 12.4h2.4" stroke="#F2A51A" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M18.6 5.1v7.7" stroke="#F2A51A" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M17.6 5.1h2" stroke="#F2A51A" stroke-widt